{"event_type":"review","id":"5b1666510470f3c3b6f3a0dcc6b7c951542c7fe9253e129e9f762fbe81af585a","occurred_at":"2026-11-05T09:23:38Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/c9c8a905f98e1b692a1b0264c2072d57eefba163a815f7197401449f8d842bf2","sha256":"c9c8a905f98e1b692a1b0264c2072d57eefba163a815f7197401449f8d842bf2"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/1fbe887c719e8ae408bc507475dcf1ad0d87ebd74c839d51abcdaadb61a11036","sha256":"1fbe887c719e8ae408bc507475dcf1ad0d87ebd74c839d51abcdaadb61a11036"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/fbdd5e387ece819c9844f0365ab50288b3bc5cb65e6714810786b95091cb7558","sha256":"fbdd5e387ece819c9844f0365ab50288b3bc5cb65e6714810786b95091cb7558"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ea8aa3036b66bbb866fde31c096cc8328cdd33b094d191cd884ad209bbde8461","sha256":"ea8aa3036b66bbb866fde31c096cc8328cdd33b094d191cd884ad209bbde8461"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9076cb8c21a49c9563aa67629d1f9ee8cbcbe5d94a5eb295b5a86b2831fcf084","sha256":"9076cb8c21a49c9563aa67629d1f9ee8cbcbe5d94a5eb295b5a86b2831fcf084"}],"attempt_id":"572c595dc1c91ac1aedecc6aede1499d56f812a4f283bdf62e5dc7e657e52f2a:0:2","base":"767713f26b2e063a2b9065f77751a73f153b6998","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"6c75605d250c7c354f4e68ef2c88ecd2453ef75d","body":"**Accept the `@<ref>` suffix in the run path check.**\n\nThe run `path` field can include a ref suffix. The REST docs example for a `push` run on `main` returns `\".github/workflows/build.yml@main\"`. Line 84 compares `$path` exactly with the bare file path. For a measure run that carries this suffix, the guard exits 1. The `propose` job then fails on every such run and never opens a proposal PR.\n\nAccept the documented suffix forms in the check:\n\n<details>\n<summary>🐛 Proposed fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-          [ \"$path\" = \".github/workflows/ratchet-propose-measure.yml\" ] || { echo \"refusing: run path '$path'\"; exit 1; }\n+          case \"$path\" in\n+            \".github/workflows/ratchet-propose-measure.yml\"|\".github/workflows/ratchet-propose-measure.yml@main\"|\".github/workflows/ratchet-propose-measure.yml@refs/heads/main\") ;;\n+            *) echo \"refusing: run path '$path'\"; exit 1;;\n+          esac\n```\n\n</details>\n\nApply this change to `policy/templates/ratchet-propose.yml`, then re-instantiate the workflow. Do not edit `.github/workflows/ratchet-propose.yml` directly.","id":"a56cb9d20d1ea8be215cf88d816837475a55ad245059a434b9e3aacd5a963ebe","intervals":[],"path":".github/workflows/ratchet-propose.yml","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Accept the `@<ref>` suffix in the run path check."}],"head":"0b42bfa7bafdc4629b84d1c20734e4bcf270990f","head_tree":"fee5d9db2f55205be15077e57e7db68b50ad920c","input_scope":[{"blob":"6c75605d250c7c354f4e68ef2c88ecd2453ef75d","intervals":[[1,156]],"path":".github/workflows/ratchet-propose.yml"},{"blob":"a023b2e54046892718d735facd4156a4f3888ae5","intervals":[[1,150]],"path":".github/workflows/ratchet.yml"},{"blob":"0d1387df5bd1672a99770f0df21af7b78269dc70","intervals":[[2,7],[10,10],[14,21]],"path":".gitignore"},{"blob":"dadb493e72f7d8b9a44110467eb45ca43968b183","intervals":[[1,9]],"path":"baselines/coverage--coverage--a8ceec8f7024.json"},{"blob":"29b334fa9f329b6e37a600abd9d40faa15be5543","intervals":[[19,23],[47,49],[74,74],[81,94],[158,162],[170,174],[239,299],[347,347],[758,759],[897,904],[907,909],[1026,1043],[1046,1046],[1049,1050],[1055,1055],[1060,1060],[1064,1064],[1067,1079],[1081,1081],[1085,1085],[1088,1089],[1095,1100],[1102,1102],[1104,1104],[1107,1108],[1121,1127],[1133,1199],[1211,1212],[1233,1236],[1258,1440],[1454,1457],[1462,1465],[1522,1522]],"path":"scripts/denylist-scan"},{"